	(text "BENCH SETTINGS (circuits/transistor-preamp/lab-settings.ts)\nJumpers: F = fitted, - = removed. Trim lines show each leg's total resistance and, in parens, what to dial the pot itself to (the leg total minus its fixed floor resistor, where it has one).\nnominal: divider bias, the brief's Build 0\n  JP1 F  JP2 -  JP3 F  JP4 -  JP5 F\n  RV1 leg 80k (trim 33k)  RV3 leg 10k (trim 5.3k)  RV5 leg 1.8k (trim 800R)  RV6 leg 0 (trim 0)\ndividerWithFeedback: divider plus collector-to-base feedback, Build 2A (DC-coupled)\n  JP1 F  JP2 F  JP3 F  JP4 -  JP5 F\n  RV1 leg 80k (trim 33k)  RV2 leg 1M (trim 530k)  RV3 leg 10k (trim 5.3k)  RV5 leg 1.8k (trim 800R)  RV6 leg 0 (trim 0)\ncollectorFeedback: collector-feedback bias with a base-to-ground leg, Build 2B\n  JP1 -  JP2 F  JP3 -  JP4 F  JP5 F\n  RV2 leg 470k (trim 0)  RV4 leg 150k (trim 103k)  RV5 leg 1.8k (trim 800R)  RV6 leg 0 (trim 0)\ncollectorFeedbackOnly: collector-feedback bias alone, Build 2B\n  JP1 -  JP2 F  JP3 -  JP4 -  JP5 F\n  RV2 leg 1.3M (trim 830k)  RV5 leg 1.8k (trim 800R)  RV6 leg 0 (trim 0)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
